# Copy to `.env` for local development. The real value must NOT be committed —
# `.env` is gitignored and CI secret-scans it (see scripts/secret-scan.py).

# Paystack PUBLISHABLE key (pk_test_... locally, pk_live_... in production).
# This one is safe to expose in a browser bundle: Vite inlines VITE_* variables
# into the built JS, which is why the Giving page's checkout works client-side.
#
# In production this must be set in the deploy environment (Vercel -> Project ->
# Settings -> Environment Variables), not read from a committed file: Vite reads
# it at build time, so a missing variable means the Giving page falls back to its
# "not configured" state rather than failing the build.
VITE_PAYSTACK_PUBLIC_KEY=
